    "title": "Tucker Carlson Network",
    "description": "News coverage in the West has become a tool of repression and control. Journalists act as censors on behalf of entrenched power. They have contempt for the public. They hate the truth. \r\n\r\nIn response, Tucker Carlson formed the online streaming platform TCN, guided by one simple principle: Tell the truth. \r\n\r\nIt\u2019s the only thing that can save us. There is no political solution to what we see; people have to change inside. That begins when they hear something true. \r\n\r\nTeam Tucker is a community dedicated to the pursuit and defense of the truth. They make all our work possible. Members enjoy exclusive benefits, including speaking directly with Tucker Carlson, behind-the-scenes content, ad-free viewership, and more. \r\n\r\nTogether with Team Tucker, this is our commitment: Discover the truth. Defend it together.",
